// Reel — commands/convert.rs
// Video conversion commands. Currently stubbed — the codec
// pipeline will be implemented per the plan in PLAN.md:
//
//   - H.264/H.265 encode: Windows Media Foundation (OS-licensed)
//   - AV1 encode: rav1e crate (royalty-free, Apache-2.0)
